at</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">v</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">c</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a>   <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./MPN32/Bits.html#MPN.W32.shlStep\">shlStep</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#Nat.toUInt64\">toUInt64</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> <span class=\"fn\">c</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN32/Bits.html#MPN.W32.shlStep_spec","kind":"theorem","line":44,"name":"MPN.W32.shlStep_spec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN32/Bits.lean#L44-L73"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Bits.html#MPN.W32.shlStep\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">shlStep</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">v </span><span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Limb `v` shifted left by `s < 32` bits, plus the carry `c < 2^s`; the bits above go up. The carry\nout depends on `v` only, not on `c`, which keeps the loop free of a dependency chain: `c` lands in\nthe `s` low bits, which the shift leaves zero, so the sum doesn't wrap.","docLink":"./MPN32/Bits.html#MPN.W32.shlStep","kind":"def","line":35,"name":"MPN.W32.shlStep","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN32/Bits.lean#L35-L42"}}],"imports":["Init","MPN.Bitwise","MPN.Shift","MPN32.Basic","MPN32.Mul.Limb"],"instances":[],"name":"MPN32.Bits"}